  "id": "hunting-behavior",
  "term": "hunting behavior",
  "definition": "Hunting behavior is the pattern or strategy an animal uses to find and capture prey. In this packet, it refers especially to estuarine crocodiles’ mainly nocturnal, low-energy \"sit and wait\" approach, in which success depends on repeated behavioral routines.",
